<title>USA: Group sells stake in Excal Enterprises.</title>
<headline>Group sells stake in Excal Enterprises.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Apollo Capital Management Group LP said Monday it sold its stake in Excal Enterprises Inc, consisting of 636,272 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group sold the stock on August 21 at $3.30 per share.</p>
<p>The sale was part of private sales of the securities, the filing said.  </p>
<p>The group had held a 13.7 percent stake in the company, according to a previous filing with the SEC.</p>
</text>
